# Netlify redirects. Both of these were live 404s drawing search impressions
# (Search Console, Sep 2026): /contactus is a mistyped contact URL people and
# crawlers reach for, and /blog is the pre-launch path from before the section
# was renamed to /insights.

/contactus      /contact/     301
/contact-us     /contact/     301
/blog           /insights/    301
# Old post slugs do not map one-to-one onto the current insights slugs, so send
# them all to the index rather than to a URL that would 404 after a second hop.
/blog/*         /insights/    301
