# studies the same day at the owner's request; keep the old URLs working.
/insights/gen-z-symbolic-capital                    /case-studies/gen-z-symbolic-capital/                    301
/insights/future-of-work-signals-in-a-fish-market   /case-studies/future-of-work-signals-in-a-fish-market/   301
